,45,'values_desc','From the farm gate price we pay to the day we roast, every step is chosen to make the cup better, not cheaper.'),(659,45,'_values_desc','field_eo_values_desc'),(660,45,'shop_title','Fresh on the <em>menu.</em>'),(661,45,'_shop_title','field_eo_shop_title'),(662,45,'shop_desc','Eight coffees, rotating with the harvest. Every bag is 340 g, available whole bean or ground.'),(663,45,'_shop_desc','field_eo_shop_desc'),(664,45,'bundle_title','Three bags. <em>One box.</em> Ten percent off.'),(665,45,'_bundle_title','field_eo_bundle_title'),(666,45,'bundle_desc','Pick any three coffees and we pack them together. Mix roast levels, try a new origin, or stock up on a favorite.'),(667,45,'_bundle_desc','field_eo_bundle_desc'),(668,45,'sub_title','Never run out <em>again.</em>'),(669,45,'_sub_title','field_eo_sub_title'),(670,45,'sub_desc','Choose a coffee or let our roaster pick. Set your cadence, save 15% on every bag, and change your mind whenever you like.'),(671,45,'_sub_desc','field_eo_sub_desc'),(672,45,'story_title','Ten years, one <em>Probat,</em> a lot of notebooks.'),(673,45,'_story_title','field_eo_story_title'),(674,45,'story_text','<p>We started in 2016 with a 5 kg roaster in a garage on Division Street. Today we roast on a 25 kg Probat in the same neighborhood, still in small batches, still tasting every one.</p><p>Every coffee on this page has a roast log, a cupping score and a farm we can name. If you want to know more about any of them, ask us. We like talking about it.</p>'),(675,45,'_story_text','field_eo_story_text'),(676,45,'story_image','18'),(677,45,'_story_image','field_eo_story_image'),(678,45,'story_image2','19'),(679,45,'_story_image2','field_eo_story_image2'),(680,45,'cafe_title','Come taste it <em>at the source.</em>'),(681,45,'_cafe_title','field_eo_cafe_title'),(682,45,'cafe_image','20'),(683,45,'_cafe_image','field_eo_cafe_image'),(684,45,'cafe_address','2214 SE Division St\nPortland, OR 97202'),(685,45,'_cafe_address','field_e